.TH TUXOMAGE 6 "2026-11-16" "tuxomage @VERSION@" "Games"
.SH NAME
tuxomage \- penguin-themed tower-building card duel against the computer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tuxomage
.RB [ \-\-fullscreen ]
.RB [ \-\-mute ]
.RB [ \-\-lang " " hu | en ]
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.RB [ \-h | \-\-help ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tuxomage
is a card game for one player against the computer. Each side has a Tower,
a Firewall and three producers (Compiler, Kernel, Colony) which add Code,
Bytes and Penguins to their stocks at the start of every own turn.
Each turn play one of your six cards (paid from the stock of its colour)
or discard one. Damage hits the Firewall first. Win by building your Tower
up to the goal, destroying the enemy Tower, or collecting enough of any
resource. Four presets (classic, quick, fortress, marathon) and three
difficulty levels are available. The gameplay is inspired by Arcomage;
the game is not affiliated with it and uses none of its content.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-fullscreen
Start in fullscreen mode.
.TP
.B \-\-mute
Do not open the audio device (no music, no sound effects).
.TP
.BR \-\-lang " " hu | en
User interface language (default: the saved setting, initially Hungarian).
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a short help text and exit.
.SH CONTROLS
.TP
.B Left click
play a card
.TP
.B Right click, or drag onto the bin
discard a card
.TP
.BR D " or the bin button"
toggle discard mode
.TP
.BR 1 \(en 6 ", " Shift+1 \(en 6
play / discard the given card
.TP
.B M
music on/off
.TP
.B S
sound effects on/off
.TP
.B F11
toggle fullscreen
.TP
.B Esc
pause menu
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/tuxomage/save.json
statistics, high scores and settings (honours
.BR XDG_DATA_HOME ).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TUXOMAGE_DATA_DIR
override the directory of
.IR save.json .
